            <ArticleTitle>Respiratory depression following combination of epidural buprenorphine and intramuscular ketorolac.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>898-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 48-year-old man who had undergone thoracotomy for carcinoma of the middle third of his oesophagus developed severe postoperative respiratory depression following intramuscular ketorolac 30 mg 2 h after 150 micrograms epidural buprenorphine. Summation of analgesia by drugs used in combination can have deleterious respiratory effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
